    // --- Complete Technical Data ---
    technicalOverview:
      "Raymond Ispat India is a premier manufacturer, supplier, and exporter of high-grade Stainless Steel 316 and 316L Pipes in Mumbai, specifically engineered for superior performance in chloride-rich and acidic environments. These austenitic nickel-chromium grades are distinguished by the addition of 2% to 3% molybdenum, which significantly enhances resistance to pitting and crevice corrosion. While both grades offer exceptional durability, the SS 316L (Low Carbon) variant is specially formulated with reduced carbon to prevent intergranular corrosion during welding, making it the preferred choice for heavy-gauge components and complex fabrications.",

